WEBVTT

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:29.540
"Sakura Empire"

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:35.830
Oh.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:41.620
They're back. They're back!

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.620
"Heavy Cruiser <i>Kako</i> "                          "Heavy Cruiser <i>Furutaka</i> "

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.790
"Aircraft Carrier <i>Souryuu</i> "                         "Aircraft Carrier <i>Hiryuu</i> "

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:54.620
Welcome home, Akagi.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:57.410
Thank you for the
warm welcome, Kako, Furutaka.

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.540
Did anything noteworthy
occur while we were away?

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:03.870
No, nothing. Also, Nagato
wishes to speak with you.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:07.410
I know. I will report to her now.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.910
Welcome back, Ayanami.

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:10.120
Thank you. I'm home.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.290
Are you okay?

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:13.160
Look, she's back!

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.330
Hey, Ayanami!

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:19.500
"Destroyer <i>Yukikaze</i> "                                              "Destroyer <i>Shigure</i> "
"Destroyer <i>Yuudachi</i> "

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:19.500
I, Yukikaze, have gone out of my way
to welcome you home! Be grateful!

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.910
So how was it?! How many did you sink?

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.540
Umm...

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:27.700
Let's listen to her stories over some tea.

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.790
Yay! Food!

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:31.750
Food! Food!

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.250
How restless...

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.580
Oh, I think it's charming and cute.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.870
I have returned.

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:51.040
Good work out there. I'm glad you're safe.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.830
You won't believe it, Soryuu!

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:58.540
Our 1st Carrier Division elders
are such tough leaders!

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:01.750
What's wrong, Zuikaku? Why the long face?

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:08.250
No, I'm fine. It's nothing, Hiryuu.

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:18.910
Grey Ghost.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.200
I will get you next time!

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.330
Good morning, Enterprise.

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:57.080
What exactly are we doing here?

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.540
I prefer coffee.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:05.450
Coffee is a wonderful beverage,
but too much can hurt your stomach.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.580
Especially if your stomach is empty.

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.370
I've had plenty to eat.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.040
Out of the question.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:16.450
Enterprise, you will improve
your way of living.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:21.500
Running on a strict and regular schedule
is key to leading an elegant life.

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:32.500
Why are you interfering in my life?
What are you thinking?

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.620
I would like to witness something.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:35.620
What?

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.500
The human soul hidden inside you.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:45.910
I don't get it.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.500
How are the Dragon Empery girls doing?

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.620
It seemed like the elder sister
was badly injured.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.120
They are...

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:04.450
One order, coming up!

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:13.080
Why does Hammann have to help?!

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.700
<i>Jiayou.</i> Keep at it.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:17.250
Ping Hai! Don't eat the stuff we're selling!

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.120
They started a business.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.910
Their resilience is quite exemplary.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.080
Here you go.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.910
Hmm? Oh, no, thank you...

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:29.910
My sister said not to worry about payment.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.910
You saved us. We want to thank you.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:57.620
It's delicious.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:59.790
Yes, it's delicious!

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:09.330
I hope Ayanami can eat with us next time.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:10.330
Huh?!

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:10.950
You refuse?

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.120
No! Of course not.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.790
You're right. It would be great
if Ayanami could join us...

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:28.500
The Dragon Empery detected
some suspicious activity by the Sirens.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:31.410
It could be a sign that they're
preparing a massive attack.

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:34.910
We went out on a scouting mission
to find out more, but...

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:56.370
You mean high-class Sirens
could be doing something?

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.410
Hornet, mind your manners.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:06.370
The Dragon Empery are one of
the camps in the Azur Lane alliance.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:09.910
They brought us this information.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.540
Maybe they're trying to strike while

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:15.290
Azur Lane and Red Axis
are fighting each other...

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:20.450
Increased Siren activity
and Sakura Empire's new technology...

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:23.370
Their ability to control mass-produced Sirens.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:27.750
It can't be a coincidence.
We should look into it.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:31.320
That is an activity we Royal Navy excel in.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.290
What?

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:36.250
We, the Maid Corps,
are already on a new mission.

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:38.620
Maids? On a mission?

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:46.040
"Cloak and Dagger"... Espionage.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.250
Big Sister, let's go eat some <i>anmitsu!</i>

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.250
It's a race!

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.910
Careful--you must not overeat.

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:59.370
Where do they get so much energy?

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:19.830
"Battleship <i>Nagato</i> "

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:19.830
So this is the Black Box that
allows us to command the Sirens?

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:23.040
Yes. But that is only a byproduct.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:30.580
The Black Box is also a Mental Cube--
the same material we warships are made of.

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:32.160
Project Orochi.

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:35.950
Yes. The shining hope for us Sakura Empire.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:40.040
But it forced us to make the first move...

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:41.620
It was inevitable.

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:46.450
Major clashes between us and the Sirens
have occurred numerous times until now.

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:49.330
Humanity is only barely surviving.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:52.620
The Azur Lane's strategy
simply will not be fast enough.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:57.120
For the Sakura Empire to have a future,
we must complete this project at all costs.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.950
I understand. You are excused.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:11.330
I suppose warfare does not change,
no matter what era we are in.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:15.000
She is still having hesitations...

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.870
Nagato lacks determination.

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:22.000
Don't speak badly of her.
She, too, is driven by a deep, strong love.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.330
But, dear sister...

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.120
But it's not enough...

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:30.910
My love is strong enough to incinerate
the entire world and still keep burning.

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:39.080
Yes, it is soon.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:40.700
My dear sister Akagi...

00:10:56.290 --> 00:11:02.120
So this Enterprise girl beat Kaga?
Wow, that's intense.

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:06.700
If it were up to me, Yukikaze, Eagle Union
and Royal Navy would stand no chance!

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:09.500
Calm down and eat slowly...
Here, have some tea.

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:15.450
I'm so jealous of you, Ayanami,
for getting to go into battle.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:17.660
I can't wait to fight!

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:27.250
I don't like fighting...
I'm just doing what's expected of me.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.750
What's expected of you?

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:32.160
You're "The Demon" Ayanami! Come on!

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:34.540
Demon! Demon horns!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:38.540
Those aren't horns, they're my ears...

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:40.370
You can't just be strong, though.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:43.580
You have to be blessed with good fortune,
like me, the famous Shigure.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.200
Ooh, I won a freebie.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:51.290
Enough, Shigure!
Time to settle this once and for all!

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:53.700
Quiet in the restaurant!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.580
"Heavy Cruiser <i>Takao</i> "

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:16.160
Training hard, Takao?

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:18.540
Zuikaku. You have returned.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:22.500
Yeah... But I can't say I did well.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:23.700
Hmm.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:52.410
I didn't stand a chance against Grey Ghost.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:54.750
I can't stay like this.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.910
I have to be stronger, or else I can't
protect Shokaku and the others...!

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:05.410
Oh, apologies... I may have hit too hard.

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:09.620
You must not take on
every burden by yourself.

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:12.120
You must rely on us as well,
at least a little more.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:13.370
Takao.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.830
We are companions, are we not?

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:28.620
"Destroyer <i>Shiranui</i> "

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:31.700
Where is that bumbling fool
Akashi slacking off at...?

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:37.040
Oh, are you okay?

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.950
By the way, are you...?

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.000
Oh... Excuse me.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:54.160
You dropped this.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.700
Why was I assigned to
this under cover mission?!

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.120
I'm totally not cut out for it!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.660
Quiet, please.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:24.660
We've studied their logistics. It seems
like they are building something massive.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.750
But... where?

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:36.910
Shiranui doesn't know how to
treat a cat. I can't take it anymore.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:39.580
Where am I?

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.910
I'm lost...

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:13.370
Is this the Project Orochi ship?

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:15.830
It looks just like a Siren ship...

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:18.660
Is it really okay to build something like this?

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:23.080
Akagi? What is she doing?

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:44.250
With so much energy gathered,
the activation of Project Orochi is imminent.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.660
Is that...?!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:53.250
"Observer"

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:51.040
At this rate, I'd say...

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.250
One more, perhaps.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:01.250
The goal of the Orochi Project
is not to create an ordinary ship.

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:07.160
It's a... shall we say... An ark,
carrying every wish across the ocean.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:15.160
Your reunion is soon.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:18.040
Leave this place. You don't want to be seen.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:22.660
Oh, dear, oh, my. I saw something terrible...

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.120
You there. What are you doing?

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:27.580
You saw.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:32.120
Wh-What are you talking about?
I just got lost...

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:37.370
Oh, she saw. Well, too bad, I guess.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:40.660
Like they say, curiosity killed the cat, right?

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:44.540
No! Help me!

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:44.540
Halt.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:47.500
I won't let you have
your way in the Sakura Empire.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:51.790
You say that, but you must know
she can't just be left alone, right?

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:58.700
Who are you?!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.910
That ludicrous outfit--you're Royal Navy!

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:23.450
Dear sister!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:27.250
Edinburgh!

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:35.160
I got it, Sheffield!

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:37.410
Retreat!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.330
Impudent fools!

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:50.660
Oh, dear. This is on you, Akagi.

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:59.160
What's going on?!

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:02.700
What is this?! What is this?!

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.080
Hey, what's happening?!

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:10.160
Furutaka, stay vigilant.

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:11.290
Wait, what?!

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.700
What was that?

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:19.330
I prefer gold ingots!

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:23.120
You can complain later.
Why are you carrying that extra load?

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.950
Don't leave me behind!

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:27.040
Why are you following us?!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:30.080
They would have gotten rid of me! Silenced!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:32.160
Dead cats tell no tales!

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:35.290
I suppose we have to see this through.
Let's head for the ocean.

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:45.500
If we can make it to that small island...

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:47.450
Watch out!

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:54.540
You're not getting away!

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:58.000
I will handle her! Go ahead
without me, Edinburgh!

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.330
B-But Sheffy!

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:28.580
This is absurd.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:32.000
Slow and steady wins the race.
Dripping water wears away the stone.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.040
My sword has been trained
over a long period of time...

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:36.160
There is nothing it cannot sever!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.870
My praise goes to you, my enemy.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:10.080
Reinforcements.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.660
What should I do? What should I do...?

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:16.000
Umm, aren't you going to run away?

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:17.700
I have to do something...

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.290
What is it?

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:29.540
"Unexploded bomb disposal area"
"Danger: None shall enter."

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.410
What is this?

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:34.580
Edinburgh!

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.000
Sheffy, over here!

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:39.950
It's on fire!

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:41.750
This is a bit...

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:42.910
Bad, yes.

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:45.620
Don't come this way!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:48.660
Somebody stop me, please!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.450
I must apologize, dear sister...

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.660
The enemy has escaped.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:10.660
I see. That's too bad.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.700
The enemy has taken the Black Box.

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:16.290
Organize a pursuit force.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:19.700
But this could be good for us.

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:21.000
Dear sister?

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:24.830
If the Azur Lane are going
to nurture the Black Box for us,

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:27.040
perhaps we should accept their help.

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:33.620
Thank you, Ayanami. You saved me.

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:36.040
Please don't mention it. I'm glad you're okay.

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:37.500
Ayanami!

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:41.750
Whoa, Ayanami... Are you okay?

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:46.660
She's with me, Yukikaze, the goddess
of good fortune! Of course she is!

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:50.910
I'm late to the party again! I wanna fight!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.250
You all get along very well.

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:00.700
Yes. They are my precious friends.

00:22:08.540 --> 00:22:11.290
So I have to, for everyone...

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:34.290
<i>The ripples seeing each other</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>Are messages exchanged with you</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:46.080
<i>Connecting us across this blue ocean</i>

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>Guideposts of light</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>Have you met someone nice?</i>

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:03.040
<i>Are your days filled with smiles?</i>

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>Filling your melancholy eyes with light</i>

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>When the starshine wanes in them</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.500
<i>I'm close to you</i>

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.620
<i>Always by your side</i>

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.870
<i>you can't see the next day</i>

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:37.160
<i>I am calling out to your heart</i>

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:42.080
<i>Please stay with me</i>

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>Please don't give up</i>

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:57.200
<i>Until the morning comes</i>
<i>when we can hold hands</i>
